---
import PassRateChart from './PassRateChart.astro';
import { budgets, headline as h, pct0, series, tiles } from './model';
---
<section class="rule" id="results">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Example results · {h.perBudget} tasks at each of {h.nBudgets} budgets</p>
    <h2 id="chart-t">Pass rate by tool budget</h2>
    <p class="lede" id="chart-d">The same {h.perBudget} questions, asked with more and more tool definitions in context. {h.names.b} passes {h.hsB} against {h.names.a}'s {h.hsA} at {h.hsRatio}× the cost; tool search cuts {h.names.a}'s bill from {h.costA} to {h.costTs} and costs it {h.tsDrop} points.</p>
    <div class="card chart-card">
      <ul class="key">{series.map((s) => <li><span class:list={['sw', { 'sw-dash': s.dashed }]} style={`--c:${s.colour}`} />{s.name}</li>)}</ul>
      <div class="chart-w"><PassRateChart W={1060} H={380} ml={52} mr={210} mt={16} mb={44} fs={14} labels /></div>
      <div class="chart-n"><PassRateChart W={343} H={250} ml={38} mr={22} mt={12} mb={36} fs={12} labels={false} /></div>
      <p class="x-title">Tokens of tool definitions loaded (median per task)</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tiles">
      {tiles.map((t) => (
        <div class="tile">
          <div class="tile-h"><span class:list={['sw', { 'sw-dash': t.dashed }]} style={`--c:${t.colour}`} />{t.name}</div>
          <div class="tile-v">{t.rate}<span class="tile-u"> passed</span></div>
          <div class="tile-m">{t.passedAll} of {t.tasksAll} tasks · {t.cost} in all · {t.perPass} per pass</div>
          <p class="tile-note">{t.note}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <details>
      <summary>Show the numbers</summary>
      <div class="tbl">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Pass rate</th>{budgets.map((b) => <th scope="col">{b.label}</th>)}</tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            {series.map((s) => (
              <tr><th scope="row"><span class:list={['sw', { 'sw-dash': s.dashed }]} style={`--c:${s.colour}`} />{s.name}</th>{s.rates.map((v) => <td>{pct0(v)}</td>)}</tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </details>
    <p class="src">From the example reports: the scale-160 recipe, graded by the claude-code judge. No budget shows a clear gap between {h.names.a} and {h.names.b} (McNemar p ≥ {h.pMinBudget} at every budget).</p>
  </div>
</section>
